sequenceDiagram
  actor V as Verifier
  participant W as Web app
  participant S as Vouch API
  participant C as Smart contract
  V->>W: Scan certificate QR (expected hash) + add file
  W->>S: POST /api/verify (file, expectedHash)
  S->>S: SHA-256 of received bytes
  S->>C: verify(hash)
  alt hash registered
    C-->>S: exists, timestamp, uploader ref
    S-->>W: AUTHENTIC
  else expected hash registered, file differs
    S->>C: verify(expectedHash)
    C-->>S: exists
    S-->>W: TAMPERED
  else nothing registered
    S-->>W: NO RECORD FOUND
  end
  Note over V,C: Independent path: the browser or CLI hashes the file itself and calls the contract over JSON-RPC, so the Vouch server is not involved at all.
